translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_236b60f9:

    # "Looking at him, you can't help but see the pain on his muzzle, present even as he lays unconscious."
    "看着他，即使他昏迷不醒，你也不禁注意到他口鼻处仍带着痛苦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_7f237298:

    # "He found this cave. Wanted to use it to help his fellow werewolves."
    "他发现了这座洞穴，想用它来帮助其他狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_d2010697:

    # "He does not deserve to die here, alone and insane."
    "他不该死在这里，孤独而又神志不清。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_f6f7e468:

    # "You rush over to his side, dropping to one knee and putting one arm between his legs, the other grabbing his forearm."
    "你冲到他身边，单膝跪下，一只手臂从他双腿之间穿过，另一只手抓住他的前臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a59b3669:

    # "As you heft Vurro onto your back, you stumble forward, nearly thrown off balance by his unexpected weight."
    "你把伏罗扛到背上时，脚步踉跄，意外的重量险些让你失去平衡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_2eb51775:

    # "Regardless, you turn to the distant light of the cave mouth, barely filtering through the falling brown sheets of dust before you."
    "不管怎样，你转向远处的洞口微光，那光线在眼前飘落的褐色尘幕间几乎透不过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_3ed1cfb5:

    # "You sprint forward, charging with the full weight of two people, doing your best not to fall off balance."
    "你背负着两个人的全部重量向前冲刺，竭力不让自己失去平衡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_75c02162:

    # "Just as you reach the cave entrance, you remember an important detail Wuldon had mentioned."
    "就在你抵达洞口时，想起了伍尔顿提到过的一个重要细节。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c805c14f:

    # "The cave entrance is too small for werewolves."
    "洞口对于狼人来说太小了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_5116d9b7:

    # "Horrified, you drop Vurro, and look for something, anything to save you."
    "你惊恐地放下伏罗，寻找着能救你的东西，什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_f28aa1ec:

    # "There, in the corner, you see a pickaxe, rusted and covered in cobwebs. A faded remnant of a man's dream, and your only hope."
    "在那里，角落里，你看见一把镐，锈迹斑斑，覆满蛛网。那是一个男人梦想褪色的残痕，也是你唯一的希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_b35ffa2a:

    # "Immediately, you grab it, and run to hack open the entrance."
    "你立刻抓起它，跑去凿开洞口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6a61a1bf:

    # "Now that the cave is falling apart, the opening to the cave is cracked and poorly held together."
    "既然洞穴正在坍塌，洞口已经裂开，勉强支撑着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_4a0a2b24:

    # "You slam the pickaxe into the cave's entrance with the desperation of a man on the edge of the abyss."
    "你带着一个濒临深渊之人的绝望，狠狠地将镐砸向洞口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_65b182ac:

    # "A wide chunk is cut into the stone."
    "石头上凿出了一大块缺口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_d6acc7ce:

    # "You bring the pick down again and again, frantically chipping as much as you can, before finally, the already damaged metal crumbles to uselessness."
    "你一次又一次地抡下镐子，疯狂凿削，尽可能多地凿去石块。最终，那本就受损的金属碎裂，再也派不上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c3451227:

    # "Terrified and desperate, you throw the remnants of the pickaxe through the cave mouth, and begin heaving the displaced chunks of rock out of the way with your hands."
    "你又惊恐又绝望地把镐子的残骸扔出洞口，开始用双手奋力将移位的石块搬到一旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6a0b8b90:

    # "You widen the cave this way until it looks big enough to fit the feral werewolf's frame, before grabbing his arms and dragging him through the hole arms-first."
    "你这样把洞口拓宽，直到看起来足够容纳那头狂野狼人的身躯，然后抓住他的双臂，将他双臂朝前拖过洞口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_369a357b:

    # "You make it 10 feet away from the cave before you hear a crash."
    "你离开洞穴十英尺后，才听见一声巨响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_466c5f93:

    # "The first beam has fallen."
    "第一根支撑梁塌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_ba55c959:

    # "With that, the cave collapses. For the next 3 minutes, the world is incomprehensible to you."
    "紧接着，洞穴坍塌了。在接下来的三分钟里，你完全无法理解这个世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_d53b1d7d:

    # "There is only brown dust. It fills the air, coats the trees, the dirt..."
    "只有褐色尘土。尘土充满空气，覆盖树木、泥土……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_f21a52ae:

    # "... it is in your lungs and eyes, and if you could feel them through the ringing left behind by the cave's collapse, inside your ears too."
    "……它进入你的肺部和眼睛；要是没有洞穴坍塌后留下的耳鸣，你也能感觉到的话，它恐怕已经钻进你的耳朵里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_4bb7b986:

    # "Eventually, things become normal again. The world is still covered in a coat of brown, but you can open your eyes, blink out the filth, and cough out the invasive filth."
    "最终，一切恢复了正常。整个世界仍覆盖着一层褐色，但你可以睁开眼睛，眨眼抖落污物，并咳出侵入体内的污物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_40c779af:

    # "Vurro's brown form at your side is now several shades lighter, and firmly unconscious."
    "你身旁伏罗那褐色的身躯如今已经浅了好几种色调，而且彻底昏迷不醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_7307cf1e:

    # "His breath is thin and raspy, each breath a strained whistle."
    "他的呼吸微弱而粗哑，每一次呼吸都像吃力的哨声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_fdce59c6:

    # "Part of his windpipe seems to be constricted by the cave's dust, feeding him enough oxygen to stay alive, but not to wake up."
    "他的气管似乎有一部分被洞穴里的尘土堵住了，只能吸入维持生命所需的氧气，却不足以让他醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_0724dcf7:

    # "You get on your knees and put your hands and head against his chest."
    "你跪下来，将双手和头贴在他的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_aa1c8985:

    # "Despite still being unable to hear, you can hear his pulse is steady."
    "尽管你仍然听不见，却能听到他的脉搏很稳定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_0f59ddfe:

    # "Relieved by this fact, you reach over and unclasp his nipple rings, before promptly passing out by his side."
    "确认这一点后，你松了口气，伸手替他解开乳环，随即在他身旁昏了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_1b3963dc:

    # "The first thing you hear when you wake up is the crackling of a fire."
    "你醒来后听到的第一件事，便是火焰噼啪作响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_9663cddf:

    # "It is warm. There is something on top of you."
    "身上暖洋洋的，似乎有什么东西盖在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_dc381498:

    # "Opening your eyes, you see a rich brown-and-green ceiling, lit warmly by flickering firelight."
    "你睁开眼，看见一片棕绿相间的天花板，温暖的火光在上面摇曳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_b0942da1:

    # "Looking down, to see what is on top of you, you see a green cloak."
    "你低头看向身上的东西，发现那是一件绿色斗篷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_62ae9645:

    # "To your right is the fire you've noticed the signs of."
    "你右边就是你之前发现过迹象的那堆火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6ffeb2dc:

    # "It is not a large thing. It is only a few feet to your right, tongues of flame licking hungrily at the air, releasing the warmth you've felt caressing you since you woke."
    "那火堆并不大，就在你右侧几英尺外；火舌贪婪地舔舐着空气，释放出你自醒来后便感受到的温暖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_bbb89fd7:

    # "It was due to all of this that you didn't wake up screaming, not knowing where you were."
    "正因为这些，你才没有在不知身处何方的情况下尖叫着醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_dec4f7cc:

    # "You had a pretty good guess of where you were, but it was only confirmed as you saw a hulking blue form peer in through the cabin door."
    "你本来就已经相当确定自己身在何处了，直到一个魁梧的蓝色身影从小屋门口探头望了进来，这才彻底确认。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_db7abf94:

    # w "Well well well! Look at what we have here."
    w "哎呀哎呀，瞧瞧我们这儿有什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_f4a9579a:

    # "Wuldon is shirtless. This should have been obvious due to his cloak being on you, but..."
    "伍尔顿没穿上衣。看到你身上披着他的斗篷，这本该显而易见，可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_eb117efa:

    # "It was another thing to see it in person."
    "亲眼见到又是另一回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_e4b16552:

    # "It might have just been the shadows cast by the firelight, but the werewolf at your door was massive in every sense of the word."
    "也许只是火光投下的阴影作祟，但门口的狼人无论从哪个意义上说都魁梧得惊人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_b6560709:

    # "More so than you had thought before."
    "比你先前想的还要魁梧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_1188ba5d:

    # "His muscles were clearly visible throughout his body, even at his plentiful gut."
    "他全身肌肉分明，就连那厚实的腹部也不例外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c955854b:

    # "His shoulders were nearly as broad as the door, which you were confident could fit two of you walking side-by-side."
    "他的肩膀几乎和门一样宽，而你很确定那扇门足以让两个你并肩走过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_200dcd99:

    # "At any other time, he would be terrifying, but all you could feel was relief."
    "换作任何时候，他都会令人恐惧，但你此刻感受到的只有如释重负。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_adc1dcd8:

    # "With someone like this watching over you, you could rest soundly."
    "有这样的人守着你，你尽可以安稳休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_fb258c83:

    # "Your body still felt like it had been run over by a wagon, so that knowledge was comforting to say the least."
    "你的身体仍感觉像被马车碾过一样，因此知道有人守着你，至少可以说相当令人安心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_887e595f:

    # w "Hello? Anybody there?"
    w "喂？有人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_93baec9d:

    # "The werewolf's normally gruff face and voice were at this point tinged by a note of concern."
    "他那张平日粗犷的脸和粗哑的嗓音，此刻都透出了一丝担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_583fd6ae:

    # "It is rather difficult to think quickly."
    "想要迅速思考还真不容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_98f9ae0e:

    # "You may have suffered a concussion."
    "你可能脑震荡了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c8b4d0dc:

    # e "H-hello, Wuldon."
    e "你、你好，伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_30064baf:

    # "He cracked a smile to hear that."
    "听到这话，他咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c21e6fc3:

    # w "Ah, good, you're not dead."
    w "啊，那就好，你还没死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_e7195e79:

    # w "You're going to have to pay me rent for the night, and I don't want to have to take that from a dead man."
    w "今晚的房租你得付给我，我可不想从死人身上收这笔钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a4fdc952:

    # "Wuldon's shit-eating smirk made you pretty sure that he was kidding, but..."
    "伍尔顿那副贱兮兮的坏笑让你相当确定他是在开玩笑，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_ad8bb37e:

    # e "You're kidding... right?"
    e "你是在开玩笑……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_8225d91f:

    # "Wuldon said nothing, just keeping that smirk on his face, and raising an eyebrow."
    "伍尔顿什么也没说，只是保持着脸上的坏笑，挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_82749a17:

    # e "...please say you're kidding."
    e "求你说你是在开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_052b9224:

    # "Wuldon finally broke out into a laugh."
    "伍尔顿终于笑出声来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_7f3a51df:

    # w "Yes, I'm kidding."
    w "是啊，我开玩笑的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_e6a7708a:

    # w "Even if I did charge to take care of folks, you'd have paid more than enough by saving Vurro."
    w "就算我真的要收钱照顾人，你救了伏罗，也早就抵得上这笔钱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_eb3f466f:

    # e "...How is he?"
    e "……他怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_efe3d0eb:

    # "Actually... you sit up in alarm, cloak slipping into your lap."
    "其实……你惊慌地坐起身，斗篷滑落到腿上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_45e00406:

    # e "Wait, where is he!?"
    e "等等，他在哪儿！？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_847d148c:

    # "Wuldon's face is somewhat complicated."
    "伍尔顿的表情有些复杂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6ef33389:

    # w "Well, I currently have him outside."
    w "嗯，我现在让他待在外面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c61022b5:

    # w "He's... well, he's definitely still feral, but. He's alive and in stable condition."
    w "他……嗯，他确实还处于野性状态，不过。他还活着，情况也很稳定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_e80f5281:

    # "He sighs."
    "他叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c2fcd985:

    # w "I'm glad to finally have him back, but... I'll need to find a way to save him."
    w "我总算把他带回来了，当然很高兴，可是……我得想办法救他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c320fa1f:

    # w "For now though, you need to rest up and get back to Uffe before he kills you."
    w "不过现在，你得好好休息，赶在乌菲杀了你之前回到他身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_e6aa9834:

    # w "Find out more about that magic stone of yours."
    w "多了解一下你那块魔法石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_1e08c482:

    # "You dutifully lay back down, and pull Wuldon's cloak back over you."
    "你老老实实重新躺下，把伍尔顿的斗篷重新拉回身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_68ec5a78:

    # e "How did I get here, by the way?"
    e "对了，我是怎么到这儿来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_df86ad15:

    # w "I heard the cave collapse."
    w "我听到了洞穴坍塌的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_ff016389:

    # e "Oh, yeah. I guess that was pretty loud, wasn't it."
    e "哦，对。我想那动静确实挺大的，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_5deede1a:

    # "Wuldon chuckles."
    "伍尔顿轻笑一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_81596232:

    # w "Yeah, that's one way to put it. And even if it hadn't been, I'd have put two and two together when I saw a massive dust-cloud kick up from over there."
    w "对，这么说也行。就算声音没那么大，我看到那边扬起一大片尘土时，也能把前因后果串起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_ce498c89:

    # w "Regardless, I ran over to check on you, and sure enough..."
    w "不管怎样，我还是跑过去查看你的情况，果然……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6cb9172b:

    # "Wuldon gestures wordlessly."
    "伍尔顿一言不发地比划着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_36451584:

    # "You guess you were pretty pathetic right now. You can't even imagine how you must have looked when he found you."
    "你猜自己现在一定狼狈不堪。你根本无法想象他找到你时，你看起来会有多狼狈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_e81efaa7:

    # "Wait..."
    "等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_d330365a:

    # e "Hey, Wuldon... why aren't I covered in dust?"
    e "喂，伍尔顿……我身上怎么没沾满灰尘？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_952cdb00:

    # w "Oh, I thought you and Vurro could use some cleaning, so I took you two over by the well and cleaned you of your filth."
    w "哦，我想着你和伏罗或许需要清理一下，就把你们俩带到井边，替你们洗去了身上的污秽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_eaf1f12d:

    # "You blush."
    "你脸红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_72d879b3:

    # w "Oh calm down. It's nothing I haven't seen before."
    w "哦，冷静点。这又不是我没见过的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_be5d2f57:

    # w "Though, one of the nicer bodies I've had the pleasure to be hands-on with."
    w "不过，在我亲手接触过的身体里，你的身体算是比较不错的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a5760139:

    # "Wuldon nods, his gruff voice putting this matter of factly."
    "伍尔顿点点头，他粗哑的声音让这件事听起来理所当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_d9c50ebe:

    # w "Not that I did anything untoward. Even kept your clothes on so you'd have your privacy."
    w "我又没对你做什么不该做的事。为了让你保有隐私，我甚至还让你的衣服好好穿在身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_ae7eb76d:

    # "...still embarrassing."
    "……还是很尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_0853ded3:

    # w "Now, get some rest. I need to go check on Vurro."
    w "现在休息吧。我得去看看伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_79bf4c93:

    # w "I'll be gone when you wake up. I'll be out trying to find some herbs that I think might help keep Vurro sedated."
    w "等你醒来时，我已经走了。我会去找些草药，希望能让伏罗继续保持镇静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_5bf93a48:

    # w "He'll be staying here, hidden in a small cellar beneath the house."
    w "他会留在这里，藏在房子下面一间小小的地窖里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_824f5404:

    # e "Okay. What should I do if I want to find you again?"
    e "好吧。如果我想再找到你，该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_4dd8969b:

    # "Wuldon smiles slightly. He seems to find the suggestion sweet."
    "伍尔顿微微一笑，似乎觉得这个提议很贴心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a18828e9:

    # w "I'll be checking back in here every once in a while. We'll coincide at some point."
    w "我会偶尔回来这里看看。总有一天我们会碰上的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_71c98989:

    # "Wuldon leaves the cabin. The last thing you see of him is the back of his massive hand raised in farewell through the doorway."
    "伍尔顿离开了小屋。你最后看到的，是他那只巨大的手从门口举起，向你挥手道别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_fa032633:

    # w "I look forward to that time."
    w "我很期待那一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_27b12874:

    # "You fall back asleep soon after."
    "没过多久，你又睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_f2750ee1:

    # "When you woke up, Wuldon is nowhere to be seen..."
    "你醒来时，伍尔顿已经不见踪影……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_20b33a84:

    # "You better go back to report to Uffe."
    "你最好回去向乌菲汇报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_4de0a92a:

    # "You turn to Vurro, and quickly spit out the reasons for your decision."
    "你转向伏罗，迅速说出自己做出这个决定的理由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_f9c533c7:

    # e "Shit, I'm sorry Vurro."
    e "该死，对不起，伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_df5b7df1:

    # e "You're feral, with no cure in sight, and trying to help might kill me."
    e "你已经变得狂暴不堪，看不到任何治愈的希望，而试图帮助你可能会害死我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_3cb2247d:

    # e "I have to leave you behind."
    e "我不得不把你留在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c0ff5985:

    # "With that done, you feel just a bit less guilty about leaving him here."
    "做完这些后，把他留在这里让你感到的愧疚稍微减轻了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6e690155:

    # "Bending down, you remove his nipple rings, and turn towards the exit."
    "俯身摘下他的乳头环，转身朝出口走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_ac387493:

    # "You run at a dead sprint for the light of the cave entrance."
    "你拼命冲向洞口的光亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_66aa9613:

    # "The cave is still shifting and shaking as you reach the entrance."
    "你抵达洞口时，山洞仍在不停移位、震颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_d5fad877:

    # "You dash out onto the grass, and keep on running without looking back."
    "你冲到草地上，头也不回地继续奔跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_2bf8d8b7:

    # "That many tons of rock all falling at once will create a sizable shockwave. It is best to get as much distance between you and it as possible."
    "那么多吨的岩石同时坍塌，必然会产生巨大的冲击波。你最好尽可能拉开与它之间的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_18c27f19:

    # "Eventually, your lungs give out, and you have to sit down and catch your breath."
    "最终，你的肺部再也撑不住了，只得坐下来喘口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_602daea1:

    # "Legs and lungs burning, you rest your back and head against a tree."
    "双腿和肺部都火辣辣地疼，你靠着一棵树，让背部和脑袋倚在树干上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a20cefa7_4:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_3d415e5e:

    # "What a day."
    "真是够呛的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_691e613f:

    # "You can only hang your head in defeat at how it has all gone, looking down at the nipple rings in your hands."
    "面对这一切的结果，你只能垂头丧气地低下脑袋，看着手中的乳头环。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_3c811ab6:

    # "At least you will be able to find out more about what happened with the stone."
    "至少，你还能进一步查清那块石头究竟发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_40d3fdf7:

    # "Your head snaps up as you hear an enormous booming sound."
    "听到一声震耳欲聋的轰鸣，你猛地抬起头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a2fcecb2:

    # "Moments after, you see an enormous plume of dust erupt from the direction of the cave."
    "片刻之后，你看见洞穴方向腾起一股巨大的尘雾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_9dbae2ca:

    # "Well... that confirms what you feared."
    "嗯……这证实了你最担心的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_7832c7ca:

    # "You're glad you made it out alive, but... you can't help but think about Vurro, dead and alone in that cave."
    "你很庆幸自己活着逃了出来，可是……你还是忍不住想到伏罗——那个独自死在洞穴里的伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_215994d5:

    # "Soon, you see a blinding flash of blue streaking through the forest."
    "很快，你看见一道刺眼的蓝光划过森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_dcddc8e8:

    # "It's Wuldon."
    "是伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_b995af3e:

    # e "WULDON!"
    e "伍尔顿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_be5a0c47:

    # "The blur comes to a crashing stop; hundreds of pounds of force halting and pivoting in an instant."
    "那道模糊的身影猛然停下；数百磅的力量在一瞬间刹住并转向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a9d1873b:

    # w "[e]?"
    w "[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_a26a0922:

    # "He looks concerned. He seems to be looking around for someone or something."
    "他看起来很担心，似乎正在四处寻找某个人或某样东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_cf6752ab:

    # e "Yup."
    e "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c37beb18:

    # e "I went into the cave to fight Vurro, and, well..."
    e "我进了洞穴去和伏罗战斗，然后，呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_5171613d:

    # "You gesture vaguely to the giant plume of dust still drifting down from the sky."
    "你含糊地指了指那股仍从天空飘落的巨大尘雾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_940e2c31:

    # "Wuldon looks... sad. Sad, but not surprised."
    "伍尔顿看起来……很悲伤。悲伤，却并不惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_884494e2:

    # w "...I take it you left him in there?"
    w "我猜你把他留在里面了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_c76f9398:

    # e "... Yeah."
    e "……嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_3ef495f8:

    # "You look down, too ashamed to meet his eyes."
    "你低下头，羞愧得不敢与他的目光相遇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_818757ed:

    # e "The cave was coming down on top of us, and I didn't know if I could get out if I took him with me."
    e "山洞正在朝我们头顶塌落，而我不知道带上他的话，自己还能不能逃出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_cdbff688:

    # e "I'm sorry."
    e "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_75c8a68b:

    # "There is a long silence between you after that."
    "那之后，你们之间陷入了长久的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_6d836a56:

    # "When you finally get the nerve to look at Wuldon's face once more, you see a complicated expression on his face."
    "当你终于鼓起勇气再次看向伍尔顿的脸时，发现他的脸上流露出复杂的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_1added0b:

    # w "I understand. It is good that you are alive."
    w "我明白了。你还活着，这就好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_41b3cd5f:

    # w "I will be going home now. Do not visit me for a while. I need time to think."
    w "我现在要回家了。暂时别来找我。我需要时间想想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_009161cc:

    # "Wuldon leaves without another word, heading straight back in the direction he came from."
    "伍尔顿没有再说一句话便离开了，径直朝他来时的方向返回。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_With_Wuldon_310a8d0e:

    # "Your eyes go back to the floor. All you can do is mumble a defeated okay, and get back up."
    "你的目光再次落回地面。你只能无力地咕哝一声“好”，然后重新站起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_dfbf44ac:

    # "The Feral Werewolf finally falls unconscious."
    "那头狂野的狼人终于昏了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_3d352c7c:

    # e "That... that was... way harder than expected."
    e "那……那比预想中……难太多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_fcaf4b54:

    # "It's difficult to get the words out between gasps of breath."
    "你一边喘着粗气，一边艰难地把话说出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_5425d95e:

    # "You sit down next to the werewolf's crumpled form, and take a second to breath."
    "你在狼人蜷曲的身躯旁坐下，喘息了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_2fc6cd58:

    # "It is now that you have taken a second to clear the sound of rushing blood from your ears that you hear it."
    "直到你花了片刻，让耳中奔涌的血声平息下来，这才听见了那个声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_bfd27c16:

    # "A rumbling."
    "一阵隆隆声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_81137c6b:

    # "Panicked, you look around, and notice the walls of the cave spilling rubble and dust."
    "你惊慌地环顾四周，发现洞壁正不断落下碎石和尘土。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ad1f7121:

    # "You realize the cave is going to crumble on top of you if you do not escape."
    "你意识到，如果不逃出去，山洞就要坍塌下来，将你压在下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_1ae14bd0:

    # "The support beams around you are beginning to tremble under the ceiling's shifting weight."
    "你周围的支撑梁开始在不断移位的穹顶重压下颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_430b2b5e:

    # "You rush to get up, but look back at the pitiful, defeated clump of fur behind you."
    "你急忙起身，却回头看向身后那团可怜而狼狈的毛茸茸身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_279401b7:

    # "He might be feral, but... he spoke. Should he really be left here to die?"
    "他或许已经失去理智，但……他会说话。真的要把他留在这里等死吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_65e085d5:

    # "But you don't know when exactly the cave is going to crumble, crushing both of you beneath it."
    "可你不知道山洞究竟会在什么时候坍塌，将你们两个都压在下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ea1c55a5:

    # "Looking at it, you can't help but see the pain on its muzzle, present even as it lays unconscious."
    "看着它，你不由得注意到它口鼻部流露出的痛苦——即使它正昏迷不醒，那痛苦也依然存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_bce34346:

    # "Feral it might be, but nothing deserves to spend so long in a cave, all alone, only to die crushed."
    "它或许野性难驯，但没有谁该独自困在洞穴里那么久，最后还被压死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_07ef6914:

    # "You rush over to its side, dropping to one knee and putting one arm between its legs, with the other grabbing its arm."
    "你冲到它身边，单膝跪地，一只手伸到它双腿之间，另一只手抓住它的手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_244e0dc7:

    # "As you heft the werewolf onto your back, you stumble forward, nearly thrown off balance by its unexpected weight."
    "你把狼人扛到背上时，意外的重量险些让你失去平衡，踉跄着向前走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_2eb51775:

    # "Regardless, you turn to the distant light of the cave mouth, barely filtering through the falling brown sheets of dust before you."
    "无论如何，你转身朝向洞口远处透来的微光，那光几乎被飘落的褐色尘雾遮蔽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_3ed1cfb5:

    # "You sprint forward, charging with the full weight of two people, doing your best not to fall off balance."
    "你背负着两个人的全部重量向前冲刺，竭尽全力不让自己失去平衡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_0c7034f1:

    # "Just as you reach the cave entrance, you realize something you hadn't thought of."
    "就在你抵达洞口时，你意识到了一件之前没想到的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_b2398cd9:

    # "It's too small for werewolves."
    "洞口太小了，狼人根本过不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_6002ebf3:

    # "Horrified, you drop the feral werewolf, and look for something, anything to save you."
    "你惊恐地把这头野性狼人丢下，四处寻找任何能救你一命的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_51d60894:

    # "There, in the corner, you see a pickaxe, rusted and covered in cobwebs."
    "就在那边的角落里，你看见了一把锈迹斑斑、爬满蛛网的鹤嘴锄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_b35ffa2a:

    # "Immediately, you grab it, and run to hack open the entrance."
    "你立刻抓起它，跑过去凿开洞口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_6a61a1bf:

    # "Now that the cave is falling apart, the opening to the cave is cracked and poorly held together."
    "洞穴正在崩塌，洞口已经裂开，勉强维系着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_4a0a2b24:

    # "You slam the pickaxe into the cave's entrance with the desperation of a man on the edge of the abyss."
    "你带着一个濒临深渊之人的绝望，将鹤嘴锄狠狠砸向洞口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_65b182ac:

    # "A wide chunk is cut into the stone."
    "石壁上被凿开了一大块缺口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_d6acc7ce:

    # "You bring the pick down again and again, frantically chipping as much as you can, before finally, the already damaged metal crumbles to uselessness."
    "你一次又一次地砸下鹤嘴锄，疯狂地凿出尽可能多的空间，最终，那本就受损的金属彻底碎裂，变得毫无用处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_c3451227:

    # "Terrified and desperate, you throw the remnants of the pickaxe through the cave mouth, and begin heaving the displaced chunks of rock out of the way with your hands."
    "你惊恐而绝望地把鹤嘴锄的残骸扔出洞口，开始用双手奋力搬开被挖松的石块。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_6a0b8b90:

    # "You widen the cave this way until it looks big enough to fit the feral werewolf's frame, before grabbing his arms and dragging him through the hole arms-first."
    "你就这样不断拓宽洞口，直到它看起来足够容下这头野性狼人的身躯，然后抓住他的双臂，先拽着手臂将他拖过洞口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_369a357b:

    # "You make it 10 feet away from the cave before you hear a crash."
    "你离洞穴10英尺远时，听见了一声巨响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_466c5f93:

    # "The first beam has fallen."
    "第一根横梁塌下来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ba55c959:

    # "With that, the cave collapses. For the next 3 minutes, the world is incomprehensible to you."
    "紧接着，洞穴坍塌了。在接下来的3分钟里，你完全无法理解周遭的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_d53b1d7d:

    # "There is only brown dust. It fills the air, coats the trees, the dirt..."
    "眼前只有褐色尘土。它充满空气，覆盖树木、泥土……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_f21a52ae:

    # "... it is in your lungs and eyes, and if you could feel them through the ringing left behind by the cave's collapse, inside your ears too."
    "……它也钻进了你的肺和眼睛；要不是洞穴坍塌后残留的耳鸣让你无法感知，你甚至能感觉到它也进了耳朵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_4bb7b986:

    # "Eventually, things become normal again. The world is still covered in a coat of brown, but you can open your eyes, blink out the filth, and cough out the invasive filth."
    "最终，一切恢复正常。世界依旧蒙着一层褐色，但你已经能睁开眼，眨掉污物，也能把侵入体内的污物咳出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_c90a205b:

    # "The already brown feral werewolf at your side is now several shades lighter, and firmly unconscious."
    "你身旁原本就呈棕色的野性狼人，如今颜色浅了好几个色阶，并且彻底失去了意识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ed9371b8:

    # "Its breath is thin and raspy."
    "它的呼吸微弱而嘶哑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_857d5fc4:

    # "Part of its airway seems to be constricted by the cave's dust, feeding it enough oxygen to stay alive, but not to wake up."
    "它的部分气道似乎被洞穴尘土堵塞，使它获得的氧气只够维持生命，却不足以让它醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_9b87d06a:

    # "Relieved by this fact, you bend down and unclasp its nipple rings, before promptly passing out by its side."
    "这下你松了口气，俯身解开它的乳环，随后立刻在它身旁昏了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_21abe831:

    # "The first thing you see when you wake up is the night sky."
    "你醒来时，映入眼帘的第一件事便是夜空。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_e54ec8a2:

    # "You have no idea how long you slept."
    "你完全不知道自己睡了多久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_f5b99eed:

    # "Looking to your side, you see the still unconscious form of the feral werewolf."
    "你看向身旁，只见那头野性十足的狼人仍未苏醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_aadcc1d6:

    # "You hadn't really thought this far, but... what do you do with this guy."
    "你还真没想过接下来该怎么办，不过……这个家伙该怎么处置？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_2d82d741:

    # "He seems immune to starvation, which is nice, as it means you don't have to take care of him, but..."
    "他似乎不会因饥饿而死，这倒不错，意味着你不用照料他，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_7bc0329f:

    # "What if he wakes up?"
    "要是他醒了怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_906193d4:

    # "You quickly answer this question by remembering that you can bind him."
    "你很快想起可以把他捆起来，随即回答了这个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_47062b5b:

    # "Over the course of the next few hours, you make impromptu set of bindings using some loose scraps of cloth you'd accumulated over time, from messing up various projects for Rahim or others."
    "接下来的几小时里，你用那些随着时间积攒下来的零碎布料，临时做了一套捆绑物——那些布料原本是你帮雷希姆或其他人做各种项目时搞砸事情后留下的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_48d01ade:

    # "Now that his mouth, arms, and legs have been bound, you can properly think."
    "现在他的嘴、双臂和双腿都被捆住了，你终于能好好想想了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a20cefa7_4:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ebec935a:

    # "Well, shit."
    "妈的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_7afa4659:

    # "You really didn't think things through before you saved him, did you."
    "你救他之前根本没把事情想清楚，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_36558c3a:

    # "Uffe sent you here with the specific goal of killing this werewolf."
    "乌菲派你来这里，就是为了杀掉这头狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_b342614b:

    # "But now that you almost died trying to save him, you might as well keep him alive. Try to find a cure or something."
    "但既然你为了救他差点丢了性命，那还不如让他活下去。试着找找解药之类的吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_2ab348f9:

    # "You probably shouldn't tell Uffe about him if you want to do that, but... you'll cross that bridge later, you suppose."
    "如果你想这么做，最好别把他的事告诉乌菲，不过……这件事以后再说吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_f71fb20d:

    # "...A hiding place is probably in order."
    "……看来得找个藏身之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_8a1fcc4c:

    # "On the other edge of the clearing is a brown bush, likely previously green, big enough to hide your charge."
    "空地的另一边有一丛褐色灌木，看起来以前很可能是绿色的，大得足以藏下这个家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_b8a62580:

    # "Dragging him over there, you get to see in full detail just how mangy and depressing he is."
    "把他拖到那里后，你得以看清他究竟有多邋遢、多凄惨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_400e5a04:

    # "You really cannot do anything with him in this state. He is instantly recognizable compared to the other werewolves."
    "他现在这副样子，你实在什么也做不了。他和其他狼人相比，实在太容易认出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_6f76fc5b:

    # "Not only that, what with him being bigger than you, you cannot possibly hope to carry him without being caught."
    "不仅如此，他比你还大，你根本不可能扛着他走而不被发现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_bf5b173d:

    # "So... you resolve to leave him behind, and either try and find a cure, or tell Uffe about him."
    "所以……你决定把他留在这里，要么试着找出解药，要么把他的事告诉乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_cd0022e1:

    # "Until then, however, he will be staying in this bush."
    "不过在那之前，他会待在这片灌木丛里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_75bbda4b:

    # "This is a feral creature, even if it might have once been a person."
    "这是个野性十足的生物，即便他或许曾经是个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_8d56f328:

    # "However much you might want to save him, you know it would be risking your life for what is essentially a rabid animal."
    "无论你多么想救他，你也知道，为了这样一头本质上只是狂暴野兽的生物冒生命危险并不值得。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_6e690155:

    # "Bending down, you remove his nipple rings, and turn towards the exit."
    "你弯下腰，取下他的乳环，然后转身朝出口走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ac387493:

    # "You run at a dead sprint for the light of the cave entrance."
    "你全速冲向洞口透进来的光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_66aa9613:

    # "The cave is still shifting and shaking as you reach the entrance."
    "你抵达洞口时，洞穴仍在不断移位、震颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_d5fad877:

    # "You dash out onto the grass, and keep on running without looking back."
    "你冲出洞穴，踏上草地，头也不回地继续奔跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_2bf8d8b7:

    # "That many tons of rock all falling at once will create a sizable shockwave. It is best to get as much distance between you and it as possible."
    "那么多吨的岩石同时坠落，势必会掀起巨大的冲击波。你最好尽可能拉开自己与它之间的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_18c27f19:

    # "Eventually, your lungs give out, and you have to sit down and catch your breath."
    "最终，你的肺部再也撑不住了，只得坐下来喘息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_602daea1:

    # "Legs and lungs burning, you rest your back and head against a tree."
    "双腿和肺部灼烧般疼痛，你靠着一棵树，让背部和脑袋得到支撑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a20cefa7_5:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_3d415e5e:

    # "What a day."
    "真是漫长的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_33a9c7e9:

    # "You can still feel the adrenaline coursing through your system, and a newly released chemical slurry flooding your brain and filling you with relief at your survival."
    "你仍能感到肾上腺素在体内奔涌，新释放的化学物质涌入大脑，让你因幸存而感到宽慰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_decd05ff:

    # "You mess with the nipple rings in your hands."
    "你把手里的乳环摆弄了一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_cac9de56:

    # "It was a lot of work, but now you'll finally be able to find out more about what happened with the stone."
    "虽然费了不少功夫，但现在你终于能进一步查清那块石头究竟发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_40d3fdf7:

    # "Your head snaps up as you hear an enormous booming sound."
    "听到一声巨大的轰鸣，你猛地抬起头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_a2fcecb2:

    # "Moments after, you see an enormous plume of dust erupt from the direction of the cave."
    "片刻后，你看到一股巨大的尘柱从洞穴的方向冲天而起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_c42df555:

    # "Well... that confirms what you had feared."
    "好吧……这证实了你一直担心的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_b4318913:

    # "You sigh, tension coming out of your body all at once."
    "你叹了口气，体内的紧张感一下子全都消散了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_ae5412ad:

    # "You're glad you made it out alive."
    "你很庆幸自己活着逃了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_26ca375e:

    # "The feral werewolf's death was what you were asked for, and... however unintentionally, it's what you brought about."
    "那头野性狼人的死亡正是别人要求你做到的，而……无论多么无心，这确实是你造成的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Battle_Win_Without_Wuldon_d03109e2:

    # "You apologize to the person they may have once been, and get up."
    "你向那个他或许曾经是的人道歉，然后起身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_21fff687:

    # "Once more, you return to Wuldon's house."
    "你再次回到伍尔顿的家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_6422201d:

    # "It seems like Wuldon and Vurro are finally here, if the snoring is anything to go by. Unfortunately, the already deafening snores only seem to be louder than before."
    "看来伍尔顿和伏罗终于到了——要是这鼾声能说明什么的话。遗憾的是，本就震耳欲聋的鼾声似乎比之前更响了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_976fab3b:

    # "It seems like Wuldon and Vurro are done preparing, if the snoring is anything to go by. Unfortunately, the already deafening snores only seem to be louder than before."
    "从鼾声听来，伍尔顿和伏罗似乎已经准备完毕了。不幸的是，那震耳欲聋的鼾声听起来似乎比之前更响了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f5a13dc5:

    # "Unlike your prior experiences coming here, Wuldon's door is open, and you make it inside undisturbed."
    "和你之前来这里时不同，伍尔顿的房门开着，你毫无阻碍地走了进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_0543738e:

    # "Inside, you see Wuldon sharpening his khopesh. For once, he doesn't seem to notice you immediately."
    "进去后，你看见伍尔顿正在磨他的霍普什弯刀。这一次，他似乎没有立刻察觉到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_304ddb0b:

    # "Sneaking closer, you see that the werewolf's ears are stuffed with a copious amount of wax, clearly having lost his patience long ago, wariness be damned."
    "你蹑手蹑脚地靠近，发现那个狼人的耳朵里塞满了大量耳垢，显然早就失去了耐心，根本顾不上警惕了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b739524a:

    # "A wicked grin comes over your face as you realize you can finally exact revenge on him."
    "意识到自己终于可以向他复仇，你脸上浮现出一抹邪恶的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e02d1bf6:

    # "You creep closer and closer, stopping only when you're worried your breath may alert him to your presence. The range should be sufficient for what you want to do, however."
    "你一点一点地悄悄靠近，直到担心呼吸声会暴露自己的存在才停下。不过，这个距离应该足够你做想做的事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_86dbb6ad:

    # "Foregoing stealth, you strike out like a snake, putting your hands on Wuldon's shoulders to spook him."
    "你放弃了潜行，像蛇一样猛地扑出，将双手搭上伍尔顿的肩膀，想吓他一跳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_11e81b49:

    # "Unfortunately for you, rather than jump in surprise, Wuldon turns and gets up in the same action while slamming his hand into your throat."
    "可惜你失算了，伍尔顿非但没有被吓得跳起来，反而转身起身，动作间一掌狠狠拍上你的喉咙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_8dd810d4:

    # "Moving on pure instinct, the werewolf shoves you against the wall, where he holds you by only your neck."
    "狼人完全凭本能行动，将你推到墙上，只用一只手掐住你的脖子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_bb24a058:

    # "His teeth are bared in a snarl, his muscles bulging as his body tenses. Looking into his eyes, you see nothing of the blue werewolf you know - there is only the rage and fear of a cornered animal."
    "他龇牙咆哮，身体绷紧，肌肉随之隆起。你望着他的双眼，却看不到那个熟悉的蓝色狼人，里面只有被逼入绝境的野兽所特有的愤怒与恐惧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_108929ec:

    # "You try to yell for him to stop, but his hand against your throat prevents any coherent sound from escaping your lips."
    "你试图大喊让他住手，可他抵在你喉咙上的手让你的嘴唇无法发出任何连贯的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_2740ff67:

    # "After a few moments spent fearing for your life, you see the blue werewolf's eyes begin to clear."
    "在担心自己性命的几刻之后，你看到蓝色狼人的双眼开始恢复清明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_985f8efc:

    # "Immediately, he removes his hand from your throat and takes two steps back. The rage is gone, but the fear remains."
    "他立刻从你喉咙上收回手，向后退了两步。怒火消退了，但恐惧依然存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_bcbe3072:

    # "It's entirely likely that you're mistaken, given your own sorry state, choking and spluttering as you sag against the wall."
    "看你这副狼狈样，瘫靠在墙边，呛得直咳、喘得上气不接下气，你完全有可能是弄错了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_9b0cbf0a:

    # w "Are yo-"
    w "你是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_04002640:

    # "Wuldon realizes his voice sounds odd after only moments, taking a little longer to realize the cause. He begins speaking once more the instant he removes the wax from his ears."
    "没过多久，伍尔顿就察觉自己的声音听起来不太对劲，却又过了一小会儿才意识到原因。取出耳中的蜡后，他立刻再次开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f1660eb3:

    # w "Are you okay, [e]? If you're hurt, can I help you?"
    w "你还好吗，[e]？如果你受伤了，我能帮你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_4d67f0a8:

    # "You shake your head, but realize he doesn't know what you're saying no to."
    "你摇了摇头，却意识到他不知道你究竟是在拒绝什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a017da02:

    # e "No, I'm- {i}HRRK{/i}."
    e "不，我——{i}呃呃{/i}。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d81dea2f:

    # e "I'm-"
    e "我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e7e3e42a:

    # "You shove down the wretch that threatens to wrack your body."
    "你把那个险些将你身体折腾坏的可怜虫推倒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_5b1bac77:

    # e "I'm fine."
    e "我没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_5a6ad20f:

    # w "Is it okay for me to come over to you?"
    w "我过去找你，可以吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_ba1b65d4:

    # "As soon as you nod your head, Wuldon comes over to check on you, looking at your throat and back for any signs of bruising."
    "你刚一点头，伍尔顿便过来查看你的情况，打量着你的喉咙和后背，寻找淤青的迹象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_54b3ec42:

    # w "Thank god, you're alright."
    w "谢天谢地，你没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_eed5985a:

    # w "I don't know what I would have done if I had hurt you."
    w "如果我伤了你，我真不知道自己会做出什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_78e0cd98:

    # "Before you can process his words, Wuldon grabs you and pulls you into a deep hug that buries your head into his chest."
    "还没等你反应过来伍尔顿的话，伍尔顿便抓住你，将你紧紧拥入怀中，把你的头埋进他的胸膛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_62381748:

    # "His hands reach upwards tentatively. When you hug him back, he begins doing what he was holding himself back from, rubbing the back of your head and middle of your back gently with his hands."
    "他的双手试探着向上伸去。你回抱住他后，他便开始做那件自己一直克制着没做的事，用双手轻轻揉着你的后脑和背部中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_cd9b7ee8:

    # "The two of you stay like that for a good while. You say nothing, worried that doing so will end the moment."
    "你们就这样待了好一会儿。你一言不发，生怕开口会结束这一刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_890e711e:

    # "It is only when the two of you realize that the snoring has stopped that you break off the hug."
    "直到你们意识到鼾声已经停止，才松开拥抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_bc683c60:

    # w "I told you to always be on guard, but seem to have forgotten to do so myself."
    w "我告诉过你要时刻保持警惕，却好像把这话忘得一干二净了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_5a3c75a0:

    # "Wuldon scratches the back of his head awkwardly."
    "伍尔顿尴尬地挠了挠后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_303c1895:

    # w "Sorry about choking you like that."
    w "抱歉刚才那样掐住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_4e806cc8:

    # w "At least it teaches the lesson of training your body to react to any threat instinctively?"
    w "至少，这也算让你明白了要训练身体，让它本能地应对任何威胁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_95a003b0:

    # "He says this with a weak grin, fully knowing he's fucked up, and that there is no lesson here."
    "他脸上挂着勉强的笑容说着这话，心知肚明自己搞砸了，而且根本没起到什么教训作用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_bf379737:

    # e "It's fine, though you may not want to kill me before we kill Uffe. It would be a bit unfortunate for both of us."
    e "没事，不过你最好别在我们杀掉乌菲之前先把我杀了。那样对我们俩来说都有点不妙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_8c500918:

    # "You get an awkward chuckle at that."
    "你对此发出一声尴尬的轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c5b09aec:

    # "When it ends, you both sit in silence."
    "笑声停下后，你们两人都默默坐着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e596ab7c:

    # "It takes a bit for the two of you to realize that the house should not be silent."
    "过了一会儿，你们才意识到，屋子里不该这么安静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_db95cb0e:

    # "The two of you look over at Vurro, who is staring at the two of you owlishly."
    "你们两人朝伏罗看去，只见他瞪大眼睛，猫头鹰似的盯着你们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_25e24d81:

    # "You have no idea how much he saw or heard, and it seems neither does Wuldon."
    "你完全不知道他看到了或听到了多少，伍尔顿似乎也一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_ad63c30e:

    # v "Good morning to you too."
    v "你也早上好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_5ff4db97:

    # "Regardless of whatever he just witnessed, the brown werewolf seems to care not, slipping out of bed to grab some breakfast from a shelf."
    "不管他刚才目睹了什么，那头棕色狼人似乎都毫不在意，起身下床，从架子上拿了些早餐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_52f9d9bb:

    # w "Hey! Who said you could use the good jams?"
    w "喂！谁允许你用那些好果酱的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_469368ad:

    # "Vurro gives Wuldon a blank shrug."
    "伏罗面无表情地对伍尔顿耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e0e7cdbd:

    # v "Mm. You woke me up. Compensation."
    v "嗯。你把我吵醒了。赔偿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a986f054:

    # "It's at around this moment that the two of you realize Vurro is still half-asleep. He pulls out a seat for himself, dropping the food - sliced bread with jam - haphazardly on the table."
    "直到这时，你们两人才意识到伏罗还半睡半醒。他拉出一把椅子，随手把食物——切片面包和果酱——凌乱地放在桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_6953253d:

    # e "Do you mind if I sit down with you?"
    e "我和你一起坐下，可以吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_9d19871d:

    # v "Mm."
    v "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_0bf7f6a1:

    # "That and a shake of the head are all you get. Looking at Wuldon at your side, he gives you a shrug, pulling out a seat for himself to sit at."
    "你得到的就只有这句回应，以及一个摇头。看向身旁的伍尔顿，他耸了耸肩，拉出一把椅子坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_43c46987:

    # e "I'll take that as permission."
    e "我就当你这是同意了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c331b1cb:

    # "Grabbing a chair of your own, you sit down on Wuldon's surprisingly well made furniture."
    "你也搬来一把椅子，坐在伍尔顿那件做工出奇精良的家具上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_4c9a9a28:

    # e "I'm here to talk about what we're going to do about Uffe."
    e "我来是想谈谈我们要怎么处理乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c3d00f99:

    # "Both werewolves look at you in surprise, the shock of it waking Vurro up completely."
    "两个狼人惊讶地看着你，这一惊也让伏罗彻底清醒过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_04ac2166:

    # v "I'm surprised you're the one bringing it up, I thought you wouldn't want to do this?"
    v "我很惊讶居然是你主动提起这件事，我还以为你不想这么做呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_818658d1:

    # "You give them a nod."
    "你朝他们点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_34a93879:

    # e "I don't. But I know I have to. We've talked about it, and it's the only way for me to live."
    e "我不想。但我知道自己必须这么做。我们已经谈过了，这是我活下去的唯一办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a551429d:

    # e "It doesn't hurt that it helps the werewolves and you either."
    e "而且这也能帮到狼人和你自己，并没有什么坏处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_9ec4829f:

    # v "Well. I'm glad that you want to help."
    v "好吧。你愿意帮忙，我很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_08f695f4:

    # "The three of you wait in silence."
    "你们三人默默等待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_57946dce:

    # e "Do you, um. Do - Please tell me you have a plan."
    e "你、呃。你——请告诉我，你们有计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c5114c57:

    # "This draws amused looks from the two werewolves sitting across from you."
    "这话让坐在你对面的两名狼人露出了玩味的神色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_643e009c:

    # v "Yes, we have a plan."
    v "是的，我们有计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a5653b1e:

    # v "It's dangerous, and you'll have to play an important role, but it's a plan."
    v "这很危险，而且你得发挥重要作用，不过确实是个计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_207e90a7:

    # "A shiver goes down your spine."
    "一阵战栗顺着你的脊背窜过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_63adcbc7:

    # e "How dangerous are we talking?"
    e "到底有多危险？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_7164eb9f:

    # "Vurro gives you a toothy grin."
    "伏罗咧嘴一笑，露出满口尖牙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d6234bd6:

    # v "You'll be the one killing Uffe. Us two will handle fighting off the werewolves."
    v "杀死乌菲的人会是你。我们两个负责挡住其他狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_79bdd535:

    # "You raise an eyebrow at Vurro."
    "你朝伏罗挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_08453a48:

    # e "Isn't fighting Uffe the most dangerous part?"
    e "和乌菲交手才是最危险的部分吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_be6eaef4:

    # v "Normally I'd say yes, but when you weigh fighting Uffe alone versus fighting fifteen werewolves at once, it's not as clear."
    v "通常我会说是，但如果把你独自对付乌菲和同时对付十五个狼人放在一起比较，答案就没那么明显了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f83332b2:

    # e "Ah. I see your point."
    e "啊。我明白你的意思了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e0c817cb:

    # "You fall back into silence."
    "你又陷入沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_fa647a68:

    # e "Can I get something more detailed though?"
    e "不过，你能不能说得更详细些？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f549a1b4:

    # "Wuldon nods your way, not teasing you for your impatience for once."
    "伍尔顿朝你点点头，这次总算没拿你的急性子打趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_cf510150:

    # "It seems he's not in the mood to mess around."
    "看来他没心情开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f46d85d9:

    # w "To lay the groundwork, our plan will start at 9:30 pm, with you inside of the tribe's grounds, and us watching from as far away as possible."
    w "为了打好基础，我们的计划会在晚上九点半开始：你进入部落领地，而我们则尽可能远地在外观察。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_5712cd6d:

    # w "The tribe has developed the tradition of hunting together at 9 pm every night. It's only about half the tribe that will leave, but if we want our plan to succeed, that is when we must start."
    w "这个部落已经形成了每天晚上九点一起打猎的传统。到时候只有大约一半族人会离开，但如果我们想让计划成功，就必须在那时开始。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_7978658d:

    # "Wuldon's explanation is somewhat cryptic, as it feels like he expects you to understand the reason behind everything he's doing."
    "伍尔顿的解释有些晦涩，仿佛他料定你能明白他做这一切的缘由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_9b010b55:

    # "Helpfully, Vurro pipes up."
    "伏罗适时插了句话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_dcdcb6d5:

    # v "We don't plan on fighting everyone that stays, but the less people nearby, the better our odds."
    v "我们没打算和留下的所有人交手，但附近的人越少，我们的胜算就越大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_74285f01:

    # "The smaller werewolf nods to Wuldon, telling him to keep going. The only reason Vurro isn't explaining is probably the breakfast he's tiredly working through."
    "个头较小的狼人朝伍尔顿点点头，示意他继续说。伏罗之所以没来解释，大概只是因为他正疲惫地吃着早餐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_1570d227:

    # w "The actual plan itself is roughly as follows."
    w "具体计划大致如下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e689ec34:

    # "The werewolf takes a deep breath, working past some sort of hesitation."
    "狼人深吸一口气，克服了某种犹豫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_424ce986:

    # w "At around 9:30 in the morning, you'll go talk to Uffe and tell him you've been exploring for a while - make it clear you haven't been in town for about a week."
    w "上午九点半左右，你去找乌菲，告诉他你已经在外面探索了一段时间——要明确让他知道，你大约有一周没进城了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_916ecb04:

    # "You raise your hand to interrupt and ask a question."
    "你举手打断他，提出一个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_00b7fb0d:

    # e "Why would he believe that? If he wants to get rid of me, he'll have been monitoring me, putting this entire plan in jeopardy."
    e "他凭什么会相信？如果他想除掉我，就会一直监视我，让整个计划陷入危机。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b9cccaf0:

    # e "Do you have anything planned for that?"
    e "你们对此有什么安排吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d1821189:

    # "Both werewolves give you an appreciative look."
    "两个狼人都赞许地看了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_08bed904:

    # w "Frankly, we don't need to have anything planned."
    w "说实话，我们没必要安排什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d89b2aaa:

    # w "Uffe relies heavily on his sense of smell, so as long as we get the smell of Lusterfield off of you, he should be fooled. I'll let you use my bath so that you don't have to go into the river."
    w "乌菲非常依赖嗅觉，所以只要把你身上的卢斯特菲尔德气味弄掉，他就应该会上当。我让你用我的浴池，这样你就不用下河了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_04dc03d2:

    # "That made sense, up until you remember an important fact about Wuldon's house."
    "这话听起来合情合理，直到你想起伍尔顿的房子有个重要事实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f74eb203:

    # e "You have a bath? I've looked all over your house, and found nothing like that."
    e "你有浴池？我把你的房子里里外外都看遍了，根本没发现这种地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_3f7361af:

    # "Wuldon briefly looks over at you, opening his mouth as if to tease you, before thinking better of it. It seems it is not the time for flirting."
    "伍尔顿短暂地瞥了你一眼，张嘴似乎想打趣你，却又觉得还是算了。看来现在不是调情的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_82824cc3:

    # w "Yes, I have a bath. It's a few minutes away, and known only to Vurro and I."
    w "没错，我有个浴池。走过去只需几分钟，而且只有伏罗和我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b3a53623:

    # "Calling it 'his bath' when it was in the middle of nowhere was a bit generous, but that at least explained why you hadn't found it."
    "把荒郊野外的地方称作“他的浴池”确实有点牵强，但这至少解释了你为什么没找到它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d10ff3dd:

    # w "The plan depends entirely on Uffe being the bastard we think he is. If he doesn't try to capitalize on what he thinks is a moment of weakness, we can't kill him, and maybe shouldn't kill him."
    w "计划完全取决于乌菲是不是我们以为的那个混蛋。如果他不试图利用他以为的虚弱时刻，我们就杀不了他，或许也不该杀他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_4a140592:

    # w "Regardless. After you tell him where you're going, he's most likely going to tail you with a few werewolves of his own."
    w "不管怎样。你告诉他要去哪里后，他很可能会带上几个自己的狼人跟踪你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_acdb9b22:

    # w "As soon as you get somewhere he thinks he can get rid of you quietly, he'll go for it."
    w "你一到他认为可以悄无声息除掉你的地方，他就会动手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b91af3d6:

    # "So far, this plan is just you inviting Uffe to come over and kill you. If this is it, you're going to beat them over the head with the nearest blunt object."
    "到目前为止，这个计划不过是邀请乌菲过来杀了你。照这个计划，你就得抄起最近的钝器，狠狠敲他们的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_1d77287e:

    # w "Before he can do that, Vurro will ambush him."
    w "在他动手之前，伏罗会埋伏他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_2883f898:

    # "Much better."
    "这样好多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a6f6dbaa:

    # e "And you? Your role isn't very clear to me."
    e "那你呢？我还不太清楚你的任务是什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b445135d:

    # "The blue werewolf shrugs his shoulders."
    "蓝色的狼人耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_dc2219da:

    # w "You won't be completely isolated. Uffe is too impatient for that, and if he isn't, that's not a bet we're willing to take."
    w "你不会完全孤立无援。乌菲没那么有耐心；就算他真有耐心，我们也不敢拿这个冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_1d19ec3c:

    # w "Your safety is priority number one. In order to help with that, my job is to incapacitate any werewolves that try and interfere."
    w "你的安全是第一要务。为了确保这一点，我的任务就是制服任何试图干涉的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b7e62f2d:

    # "Holding a massive perimeter against most of a tribe sounds outright insane, but he's given you reason enough to trust his abilities."
    "要挡住一个部族的大多数人，守住那么大一片区域，听起来简直疯了。不过，他已经给了你足够的理由去相信自己的能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c2bed032:

    # "Wuldon leaves things at that, clearly seeing the debriefing as done, but Vurro pipes up again to clarify things further."
    "伍尔顿说到这里便不再多言，显然认为交代已经结束了，但伏罗又开口补充说明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_0d84cfb0:

    # v "Our job is made harder by the need to kill Uffe and {i}only{/i} Uffe. None of the other werewolves we fight are to be permanently injured or killed."
    v "我们的任务之所以更棘手，是因为必须杀死乌菲，而且{i}只能{/i}杀死乌菲。我们交手的其他狼人，一个都不能受到永久性伤害，也不能被杀死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_86ff8f59:

    # "Vurro looks slightly irritated as he says that. When he sees you looking askance, he elaborates."
    "伏罗说这话时显得有些恼火。看到你狐疑地望着他，他便进一步解释起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_2255d0eb:

    # v "It is far easier to kill someone than knock them out. Because of that, I likely won't be able to help you very much with Uffe."
    v "杀人远比把人打晕容易。正因如此，我恐怕帮不了你太多，对付乌菲尤其如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_77839fc1:

    # v "It's also just a bit frustrating to see his lack of morality give him an edge over me. Again."
    v "看到他的道德缺失反而让他占了我的上风，实在有点令人恼火。又来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_0ff8a076:

    # "The brown werewolf smiles weakly at you, clearly wishing he didn't have to rely on others for help with his plan - that he were strong enough to do it on his own."
    "棕色的狼人对你勉强一笑，显然并不希望自己的计划还得依靠别人帮忙——他真希望自己足够强，能独自完成这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_8e312e45:

    # v "While I don't think I'll be able to help you with my brother, I can at least promise to take care of the werewolves he brings with him."
    v "虽然我不觉得自己能帮你对付我哥哥，但至少我可以保证收拾掉他带来的那些狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b755593f:

    # "Fighting Uffe alone sounds extremely dangerous, but it's definitely better than any of the alternatives. Fighting anything more than two werewolves at once sounds like a death sentence."
    "独自对付乌菲听起来极其危险，但肯定比其他选择都好。一次对付超过两个狼人，听起来就跟送死没什么区别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c1acc942:

    # e "I understand, and thank you for having my back."
    e "我明白了，谢谢你愿意为我掩护。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_ca08c8f9:

    # "This did kind of suck, but it was the kind of awful you could work with. Plus, you couldn't exactly complain when he looked so guilty about it."
    "这事确实有点糟，但还没糟到无法应付。再说，他看起来那么内疚，我也实在没法抱怨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_ccbedada:

    # e "Alright. That doesn't sound terrible. Better than anything I'd thought up anyways."
    e "好吧。听起来倒也没那么糟。总之，比我自己想出来的任何计划都好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_5e1afb4b:

    # "Wuldon looks up with a bit too much interest."
    "伍尔顿抬起头来，兴趣显得有些过头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_6a715b57:

    # w "Really? I want to hear your plans."
    w "真的吗？我想听听你的计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_f1abb92c:

    # "The corners of the werewolf's lips are twitching slightly as he does his best to look genuine, and not at all mischievous. It only makes you raise an eyebrow at him."
    "狼人嘴角微微抽动着，竭力装出真诚的样子，完全不露出半点恶作剧的意味。结果反而让你冲他挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_021b4f61:

    # e "I'm not falling for that."
    e "我才不会上你的当。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c3ccb3ab:

    # "Maybe you'd believe him if he didn't look like he was holding back a laugh. Then again, there was also something off with it this time."
    "如果不是看起来在强忍笑意，也许你还真会相信他。不过话说回来，这次似乎还有哪里不太对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_0dc5d33a:

    # "The blue werewolf chuckled softly, acting greatly amused by your response."
    "蓝色的狼人轻声笑了起来，装出对你的反应极其感兴趣的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_17b3ea4c:

    # w "It seems you're learning! More than what I could say for a certain someone."
    w "看来你学得挺快！至少比某个人强多了，我可没法这么夸他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_9d5f3613:

    # "Wuldon gently nudged the smaller werewolf to his right, who gave him a half-hearted kick to the shins in return."
    "伍尔顿轻轻碰了碰右边那个较矮的狼人，对方回敬了他一脚，软绵绵地踢在小腿上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c5d436a6:

    # v "I've learned. I only indulge you out of pity."
    v "我已经学会了。我只是出于同情才陪你闹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_6af8d962:

    # "The two werewolves stare at each other with fake anger, only to snort at their shared gag."
    "两名狼人假装怒视彼此，最后却因共同的玩笑噗嗤笑出声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_29939b8e:

    # "Unlike normal, however, their laughter rings hollow."
    "然而，这次他们的笑声不像平时那样真切，听起来空洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c5fd2ece:

    # v "I wish we had more time, or that we didn't have to do this… but I wasn't supposed to get this second chance in the first place."
    v "我真希望我们还有更多时间，或者根本不必做这些……但我本来就不该得到这第二次机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_664f3430:

    # v "And I'm not going to let it go to waste."
    v "但我不会让它白白浪费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_4ea698fa:

    # "Vurro lets out a long sigh as Wuldon pats him on the back. However much both of them try and laugh it won't truly make them feel better."
    "伏罗长叹一声，伍尔顿拍了拍他的后背。无论两人怎么努力笑，都无法真正让自己好受些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_e9f7f26f:

    # v "Thank you for being with me for this, both of you."
    v "谢谢你们两位陪我一起面对这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_55cd34b1:

    # "You and Wuldon exchange a somewhat concerned glance."
    "你和伍尔顿交换了一个略带忧虑的眼神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_a1d3f842:

    # e "Well, of course I'm here! You already know I need to do this if I want to stay safe."
    e "嗯，我当然会在这里！你也知道，想确保自己安全，我就必须这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_2f1793b5:

    # "Wuldon only lets out a deep rumble, his thoughts on the matter not even needing to be stated."
    "伍尔顿只是发出一声低沉的呜鸣，他对此的想法甚至无需明说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c9999b47:

    # "Vurro gives you both a weary smile."
    "伏罗朝你们两人露出疲惫的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_db2fcfd4:

    # v "I suppose I had no reason to worry, then."
    v "那看来，我确实没什么好担心的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_77e0494a:

    # "Despite his words, Vurro is practically trembling from a mix of fear and anticipation."
    "尽管他嘴上这么说，伏罗却因恐惧与期待交织在一起，几乎不停地颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_afd63cec:

    # "The shaking stops when Wuldon places a giant hand on Vurro's shoulder."
    "伍尔顿把一只巨大的手放在伏罗肩上后，颤抖停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_b13eb421:

    # w "It's alright. We all know our parts of the plan, so why don't we all take some time to rest, and prepare ourselves before the fight?"
    w "没事。我们都清楚自己在计划中的任务，那就先休息一会儿，在战斗前做好准备吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_613b0ce8:

    # "Wuldon projects unwavering confidence, cutting any rising worries from growing further."
    "伍尔顿展现出坚定不移的自信，将刚刚冒头的忧虑扼杀在继续滋长之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_c506ae6f:

    # "Despite his best attempts, however, both you and Vurro see the way his muscles twitch as he tries to keep his unease from surfacing."
    "然而，尽管他竭力掩饰，你和伏罗还是看见他的肌肉因努力不让不安浮现而微微抽动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_65cabcbf:

    # v "..."
    v "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_8ed05974:

    # v "Alright."
    v "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_15b7e780:

    # "The tired werewolf lifts his gaze up off the table to look at you."
    "疲惫的狼人抬起视线，不再盯着桌面，转而看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_15d690e9:

    # v "You'll need to be here by 8:00 in the morning so you can bathe before we start our plan. I'll be setting up everything you need for it in the meanwhile."
    v "你明早8:00前得赶到这里，这样在我们开始计划前你就能洗澡。与此同时，我会把你需要的一切准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_97f6ba80:

    # "What might take hours to prepare for a bath, you have no idea."
    "你完全想不到，为了洗个澡竟然可能要花上几小时准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d7c55800:

    # "But you do get the feeling Vurro wants to have one last talk with you before you go."
    "但你隐约感觉到，伏罗想在你离开前再和你谈最后一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_0eeb7a9f:

    # e "I'll be there."
    e "我会去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_15d50247:

    # "Wuldon looks like he wants to say something to you, but seems to settle for moving over to you for a warm hug."
    "伍尔顿看起来想对你说些什么，但似乎最终只是走到你身边，给了你一个温暖的拥抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_d3772696:

    # "You feel a brush of warm air by your ear as he moves his head down next to yours."
    "他低下头靠到你旁边时，你感到耳畔拂过一股温热的气流。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_7b22e699:

    # w "Stay safe, little one."
    w "保重，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_ad7f472e:

    # "The unguarded worry in his voice makes you hug him back a bit harder than normal."
    "他声音中毫不掩饰的担忧，让你比平时更用力地回抱了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_7fe50e7e:

    # e "You too."
    e "你也一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_daf396d3:

    # "After a few more moments spent holding each other, the two of you separate reluctantly."
    "又拥抱了片刻后，你们两人依依不舍地分开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Preparation_8d5bac6c:

    # "With nothing else to say, you turn around and head out, leaving the two werewolves to their preparations."
    "没什么好说的了，你转身离开，把两名狼人留在那里继续准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_46bb9529:

    # "As you approach Wuldon's house, you hear a sharp ringing noise, which you recognize as the sound of a whetstone on a blade."
    "靠近伍尔顿的房子时，你听到一阵清脆的铿锵声，辨认出那是磨刀石在刀刃上摩擦的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_047bdbee:

    # "Sure enough, when Wuldon's house comes into view you see the blue werewolf at his doorstep, ritually sharpening his khopesh."
    "果然，伍尔顿的房子映入眼帘时，你看到那头蓝色狼人正站在门口，按仪式般的方式打磨着他的科佩什弯刀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_fd9ed4d6:

    # "As always, Wuldon notices you instantly, putting aside his weapon and calling for Vurro to come out front."
    "和往常一样，伍尔顿立刻注意到了你。他放下武器，叫伏罗到前面来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_39948cfb:

    # "Wuldon turns to you with a mischievous grin."
    "伍尔顿带着顽皮的笑容转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_e60919e6:

    # w "He's preparing the bath for you right now."
    w "他现在正在为你准备洗澡水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_2435586c:

    # "His grin turns to a small chuckle as Vurro comes into view, sopping wet and thoroughly unamused."
    "伏罗现身时，他的笑容变成了轻笑；伏罗浑身湿透，满脸都写着不悦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_aa5ae1af:

    # v "I think [e] could have figured that out on his own, Wul."
    v "我想[e]自己也能猜到吧，伍尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_e79356ee:

    # v "Just because you won the spar to determine who would do it doesn't mean you have to crow about it whenever you have the chance."
    v "你赢了那场用来决定谁来做这件事的比试，也不代表你每次有机会都得拿出来炫耀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_043a2ed7:

    # "Vurro pauses to shake some of the water out of his fur, making sure to catch Wuldon in the spray as the latter attempts to bat him away with his paw."
    "伏罗停下来抖了抖毛上的水，还特意让水花溅到伍尔顿身上；后者则试图用爪子把他拍开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3ff1a614:

    # "The incident ends with two slightly wet werewolves grinning at each other, both pausing as they see your bemused expression."
    "这场闹剧最后以两名微微湿透的狼人相视而笑收场；他们看到你哭笑不得的表情后，都停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_792b83cd:

    # e "And here I thought you two were in a bad mood?"
    e "我还以为你们两个心情很差呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_6d79e77e:

    # "Both werewolves wave you off, clearly dismissive of the thought."
    "两名狼人都挥手让你别说了，显然对这个想法不以为然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_9a5b2fce:

    # v "We had to be serious while we discussed the plan earlier - killing my brother is no small task, and it deserves both focus and respect."
    v "我们之前讨论计划时必须严肃一些——杀死我的兄弟可不是件小事，值得我们全神贯注并予以尊重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_e486a975:

    # v "And yes, even now, giving that task the gravity it is due is important."
    v "没错，就算是现在，认真对待这件事应有的分量也很重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_64dba1c5:

    # v "But we are all friends, and friends who may not get to spend time together again."
    v "但我们都是朋友，而且以后也未必还能再和彼此共度时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_844135ab:

    # "You hadn't noticed it at first, but hidden under the joy writ across their faces was also the pain of knowing that tomorrow would always come, with or without the people by your side."
    "起初你并没有注意到，但他们脸上洋溢的喜悦之下，还藏着一丝痛苦：他们知道，明天终究会到来，无论你身边的人是否还能相伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_9dc9f894:

    # v "We can talk about the task to come, or anything else. But I'd like to do it as friends."
    v "我们可以谈谈接下来的任务，也可以聊别的。但我想以朋友的身份这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_9168755d:

    # "His voice falters slightly as he struggles to finish his request."
    "他的声音在努力说完请求时微微颤抖起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_740fd211:

    # v "It might be selfish, but I want your last memory of me to be a good one. I want to be remembered for who I was, not for what is going to happen."
    v "可能有点自私，但我希望你对我的最后记忆是美好的。我希望你记住的是曾经的我，而不是将要发生的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_99b65af4:

    # "By the end, Vurro had his hands clasped together nervously, struggling to keep the smile on his face in the silence following his request."
    "最后，伏罗紧张地十指交握，在请求之后的寂静中努力维持脸上的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_f19b9ae7:

    # "You reach out to Vurro before you even realize what you're doing, putting your hand on his shoulder and looking him in the eyes."
    "你还没意识到自己在做什么，便伸手搭上伏罗的肩膀，注视着他的双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_733e72f8:

    # e "Of course. I want to cherish whatever time we have left together."
    e "当然。我想珍惜我们剩下的相处时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_a972a0a7:

    # "Before you could figure out anything else to say, Wuldon wrapped the two of you up in a hug, nuzzling his head against Vurro's."
    "在你想好还能说些什么之前，伍尔顿就把你们两个都搂进怀里，脑袋亲昵地蹭着伏罗的头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_f19b9ae7_1:

    # "You reach out to Vurro before you even realize what you're doing, putting your hand on his shoulder and looking him in the eyes."
    "你还没意识到自己在做什么，便伸手搭上伏罗的肩膀，注视着他的双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_733e72f8_1:

    # e "Of course. I want to cherish whatever time we have left together."
    e "当然。我想珍惜我们剩下的相处时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_0eba7b22:

    # "Before you could figure out anything else to say, Wuldon wrapped the two of you up in a hug, nuzzling his head against Vurro, before turning to you, hesitating slightly before planting a soft kiss between your ears."
    "在你想好还能说些什么之前，伍尔顿就把你们两个都搂进怀里，脑袋蹭了蹭伏罗的头，然后转向你，略微迟疑后，轻轻吻了吻你两耳之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_6ca4b64c:

    # "The silence didn't end for a while, as you struggled to form a response."
    "寂静持续了好一会儿，你努力组织着回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_c71253fb:

    # e "I can't say I deserve the honour the same way Wuldon does, but I am happy to make more memories with a new friend."
    e "我不能说自己配得上伍尔顿那样的荣誉，但我很高兴能和一位新朋友创造更多回忆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_578c01d9:

    # "In response to your words Wuldon gets up and wraps him in a hug that lifts his feet off the ground."
    "听到你的话，伍尔顿起身将他一把抱住，双脚都离开了地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_2d36e6c6:

    # w "Like I said when you asked me this earlier, it was always going to be a good memory - it's a memory of you, after all."
    w "就像你之前问我时说的，这本来就会成为一段美好的回忆——毕竟，这是关于你的回忆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_b1be4d16:

    # "So saying, Wuldon lets go of Vurro, though he still keeps his arm around your shoulders, pressing you close protectively. "
    "说着，伍尔顿松开了伏罗，但仍将手臂搭在你的肩上，带着保护意味把你拉得更近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_07d049e7:

    # "You look up at the werewolf next to you, preparing to tease him - but as you open your mouth, you hesitate, taken aback by the strange look on his face."
    "你抬头看向身旁的狼人，正准备调侃他——可刚一张口，你便迟疑了，被他脸上那副奇怪的表情惊住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_59b65f4a:

    # "So saying, Wuldon lets go of Vurro. A strange expression on face."
    "说完，伍尔顿松开了伏罗。他脸上带着奇怪的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_b271614f:

    # "Wuldon's expression was one caught between joy and grief, a melancholy smile paired with eyes that glinted with mirth."
    "伍尔顿的神情夹杂着喜悦与悲伤，忧郁的笑容映衬着闪烁着欢愉光芒的双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_36e00c80:

    # "It reminded you that even when you first found him, at the depths of despair, he had not lost his humor."
    "这让你想起，即使当初你在绝望的深渊中找到他时，他也没有失去幽默感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_08d057b4:

    # w "Let's make it the best memory we can."
    w "让我们一起把它变成最美好的回忆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_c682a240:

    # "He looks at you significantly, urging you to speak."
    "他意味深长地看着你，催促你开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_47a3c3cb:

    # e "You'll hear no complaints from me."
    e "我不会有任何抱怨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_a71a09de:

    # "Rolling his eyes at your choice of words, Wuldon reached over and wrapped his arms around."
    "伍尔顿对你的措辞翻了个白眼，伸手张开双臂抱了过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_beb790e4:

    # "Instinctually, you reach out and grab hold of the two werewolves, reciprocating the hug."
    "你本能地伸手抱住两名狼人，回应着他们的拥抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_854cd354:

    # "It took you a while to realize that this was as much a hug as it was an excuse for Wuldon to hold the two of you and protect you while he still could."
    "过了好一会儿，你才意识到，这既是一个拥抱，也是伍尔顿趁自己还办得到时抱住你们两个、保护你们的借口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_66fcb251:

    # "You can't help but laugh at the werewolf's actions."
    "你忍不住被这名狼人的举动逗笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_a8f3360b:

    # e "Alright, fine. I'll outright say it."
    e "好吧，行。我就直说了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3ffa08e2:

    # "As you speak, you wrap one arm around Vurro, and the other around Wuldon."
    "说着，你一只手搂住伏罗，另一只手搂住伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_fcfe59df:

    # e "However much I want to get rid of Uffe, I also want to treasure the little time we've got remaining."
    e "虽然我很想除掉乌菲，但也想珍惜我们所剩无几的相处时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_e0462c63:

    # "You let out a small sigh at the pair of silly werewolves' antics."
    "你对这两个傻乎乎的狼人的闹腾轻轻叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_57563c65:

    # "Still, it's hard not to like them, and at the end of the day, they were looking out for you just like you were looking out for them."
    "不过，想不喜欢他们都难，而且说到底，他们一直在照顾你，就像你也在照顾他们一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_6a938a64:

    # "Even if part of the reason you were helping them was to avoid death."
    "即便你帮助他们的部分原因，是为了逃过一死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_5cd3bc60:

    # e "You could have just asked, and I'd have come over for a hug."
    e "你直接说一声就好，我会过来抱抱你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_16822830:

    # "Despite the grouchiness of your tone, you turn to properly hug the two of them. Well, you try to - your hand can't really reach very far across Wuldon's back."
    "尽管你的语气有些恼怒，你还是转身好好抱住了他们两个。嗯，你试了试——可你的手实在没法从伍尔顿背后伸过去太远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_fccd6211:

    # w "This was more fun."
    w "这样更有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3e949822:

    # "The blue werewolf began to laugh as you grumbled good naturedly, a sound that snapped Vurro out of his temporary funk."
    "蓝色狼人开始笑起来，你则语气和善地嘟囔着。这笑声让伏罗从暂时的郁闷中回过神来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_526cd56e:

    # e "Vurro, do you have any tips for fighting Uffe? I was told that you've fought him a few times before, and I need any edge I can get."
    e "伏罗，你和乌菲交手过几次，能给我一些建议吗？我听说你以前和他打过几次，我能占到什么优势就得尽量争取。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_a49932c3:

    # "Vurro nodded genially, while Wuldon walks over to his station to prepare for his weapon."
    "伏罗友善地点点头，伍尔顿则走到自己的位置，准备拿武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_e8fdcc9b:

    # v "I was actually planning on covering that with you one on one. It would be good for us to spar so that I had some idea of your fighting abilities."
    v "其实我本来就打算单独和你谈谈这个。我们最好切磋一下，这样我就能大概了解你的战斗能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_5394633d:

    # v "Not trying to judge your battling skills, you know."
    v "我可不是想评判你的战斗本事，你知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_356f6c62:

    # "Vurro's reassuring you, but the raised corners of his mouth tells you otherwise."
    "伏罗是在安慰你，但他嘴角扬起的弧度却说明并非如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_095fec1b:

    # e "I wasn't thinking that."
    e "我没那么想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_5747412e:

    # v "You've already beaten my feral self, the state that I'm in right now is definitely not stronger in any plane of existence."
    v "你已经打败过狂暴状态下的我了。现在的我无论在哪个层面上，都绝对不可能比那时更强。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_c57ed65c:

    # e "Vurro, you just woke up, are you sure you want to spar with me? If anything I have this little blue werewolf over here to train with."
    e "伏罗，你才刚醒，确定要和我切磋吗？真要训练的话，我这边不是还有这个小个子的蓝色狼人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_9d47222f:

    # v "Heh I don't doubt that, but I have to face Uffe with you too, I suppose sparring before our bath would prove useful to prepare for."
    v "呵，我当然不怀疑这一点。不过我也得和你一起面对乌菲，我想在我们洗澡前先切磋一下，应该有助于做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_b13a6984:

    # "Vurro furrows his brows as he inspects the sharp hooks on his hand. A sense of bewilderment can be sensed on his face."
    "伏罗一边检查手上的锋利钩爪，一边皱起眉头。他脸上显露出一丝困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_85116716:

    # e "No objection from me."
    e "我没意见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_d5536a3c:

    # w "Me neither."
    w "我也没意见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3018f92b:

    # "The blue werewolf replies from afar."
    "蓝色狼人从远处答道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_1bdc367d:

    # v "Good, though I didn't remember asking the big lug over there."
    v "好吧，不过我可不记得有问那边那个大块头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_541fc1ed:

    # w "Hmmm... just don't get yourselves caught before I sharpened my weapon."
    w "嗯……在我把武器磨利之前，你们可别被抓住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_030ff95a:

    # v "Oh don't you worry, in [e]'s hand I'm just safer than you can ever imagine."
    v "哦，别担心，在[e]手里，我可比你想象中安全多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3b0f9408:

    # v "Look at thes-"
    v "看看这——"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_5eedb9ae:

    # "Vurro raises his nails, his twinkly eyes doesn't hide his own struggle to stay awake, with scrawny furs all over the place."
    "伏罗抬起爪子，他那双闪闪发亮的眼睛掩不住自己强撑着不睡的挣扎，身上到处都是稀疏的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_8b8cba2c:

    # "Wuldon seems to have noticed, his smile fades almost instantly, turning back and focusing on his weapon instead."
    "伍尔顿似乎注意到了这一点，他的笑容几乎瞬间消失，转过身去，重新专注于自己的武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_066a70f7:

    # "Without another word, you follow the brown werewolf from the slumbrous well."
    "一言不发地，你跟着那头棕色狼人离开了那口令人昏昏欲睡的井。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_ef0cfba4:

    # e "What if they somehow come here and spot you? Will Uffe know?"
    e "要是他们不知怎么找到了这里，还发现了你呢？乌菲会知道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_a9ea3ee4:

    # v "Nope, no trace or smell of any other werewolves around. We're safe out here. Uffe doesn't even know Wuldon."
    v "不，附近没有其他狼人的踪迹，也闻不到他们的气味。我们在这里很安全。乌菲甚至都不认识伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_02eeca3f:

    # v "Actually, I never expected one day this little paradise between me and Wuldon had turned into a hiding place."
    v "其实，我从没想过，有一天，我和伍尔顿之间这片小小的乐园会变成藏身之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_980be4f8:

    # v "Much much before everything changed, our father had me and Uffe playing hunting games. And at first, we both had a lot of fun."
    v "早在一切改变之前很久，父亲就让乌菲和我玩捕猎游戏。起初，我们俩都玩得很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_12674db8:

    # v "We-"
    v "我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3bc1cd65:

    # "Vurro stutters for a moment. His gaze hangs ahead."
    "伏罗结巴了片刻，目光停留在前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_92c50bde:

    # v "Maybe I spoke too fondly of a person who just tried to doom me into eternal rampage. Sometimes, I just wonder if I could have done something before our relationship became so strained."
    v "也许我把一个刚刚试图让我陷入永恒狂暴的人说得太好了。有时我只是会想，在我们的关系变得如此紧张之前，我是不是本可以做些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_492ee07d:

    # e "I don't believe you could've done anything, he is just going to end up being evil, in another way."
    e "我不觉得你本来能做什么，他终究会以另一种方式变成恶人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_cad41845:

    # v "Could be. You're right. There's no use reminiscing the person we're planning to kill right now."
    v "也许吧。你说得对。我们现在正准备杀掉那个人，没必要再缅怀他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_325e3079:

    # "Vurro silently walks ahead. You follow him to an opening enveloped by the forest."
    "伏罗默默地走在前面。你跟着他来到一片被森林包围的空地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_dc1e3bb9:

    # v "There it is."
    v "就是那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_31d5e8c5:

    # "Vurro pulls up his poncho, stretches his jaws while kicking against the dirts to get a feel of the ground."
    "伏罗撩起斗篷，活动着下颌，同时用脚踢了踢地面，感受着脚下的土地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_7c6269c5:

    # "He turns around and faces you."
    "他转过身，面对着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_db74b728:

    # v "Let's do it."
    v "来吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_3d4058fc:

    # e "Hey, Vurro. Are you really sure we've got to fight? You seem... sleepy."
    e "嘿，伏罗。你真的确定我们必须战斗吗？你看起来……好困。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_08cb7ac2:

    # v "Fighting helps me stay awake. Come on."
    v "战斗能让我保持清醒。来吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Planning_2a98a35f:

    # "Vurro raises his fist at you, his legs extends into a stable position. The fight is on."
    "伏罗朝你举起拳头，双腿摆成稳固的姿势。战斗开始了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_5eb33895:

    # v "I could've turned into the monster and killed you."
    v "我本可以变成怪物，把你杀掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_8630efcb:

    # e "And I'm still alive."
    e "而我现在还活着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_9ce0a612:

    # "You says, but quickly lower your head, obviously you don't want your friend to transform in front of you, but right now it almost seems like a certainty, the matter is just when."
    "你这么说着，却迅速低下头。显然，你不想让自己的朋友在你面前变身，但眼下这几乎已经是板上钉钉的事，只是不知道会在什么时候发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_3d09a3ae:

    # v "Fuck, why do this even happen. Why can't we just be normal for once."
    v "操，怎么会发生这种事。我们就不能哪怕一次像个正常人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_90debe36:

    # "Vurro mumbles underneath his breath, he squints his eyes shut forcefully, just to open once more."
    "伏罗低声喃喃，猛地紧紧闭上双眼，随后又睁开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_ac3de491:

    # e "Vurro, I- I'm here for you. Wuldon is too."
    e "伏罗，我——我会陪着你。伍尔顿也会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_28ef8886:

    # "The brown werewolf blinks, almost like he's snapped back into reality. He slouches against the tree, struggling to stand."
    "棕色狼人眨了眨眼，仿佛终于回过神来。他靠在树上，挣扎着站稳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_106b6d00:

    # v "I'm sorry."
    v "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c0a26f6e:

    # "You stand, and pulls up the werewolf as he rises. In spite of his short of breath, he doesn't bother more than he's worried."
    "你站起身，在狼人起身时将他拉了起来。尽管他气喘吁吁，却顾不上这些，更担心的是你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_1516fe5b:

    # "He takes a couple seconds to look around, peering ahead between trees and bushes."
    "他花了几秒钟环顾四周，透过树木和灌木丛眺望前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_e459ac00:

    # v "But, we're fine now. So, that's a relief."
    v "不过，我们现在没事了。这下总算松了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_60ebced8:

    # e "Are you sure?"
    e "你确定吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_ebda40ce:

    # v "Yes, I'm not dead yet."
    v "是的，我还没死呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_d1b337b8:

    # "It's painful having to watch your friend slowly descend into the monstrous form, powerless to the inevitability. Maybe there's a light at the end of this dark tunnel, but you doubt it."
    "看着你的朋友一点点沦为怪物，而自己又无力阻止这一必然结果，实在令人痛苦。也许这条黑暗隧道的尽头有一线光明，但你对此并不抱希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_d9047e53:

    # "But the brown werewolf quickly picks up on your lowered head, Vurro's brows relax immediately, he just seems much less distressed than you do."
    "但棕色狼人很快注意到了你低垂的脑袋，伏罗的眉头立刻舒展开来；看来他远没有你那么难受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_4d825470:

    # v "Come on, little one. The bath's getting cold."
    v "来吧，小家伙。浴池里的水快凉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_3df49146:

    # "He extends a faint smile, before heading back."
    "他露出一丝淡淡的笑容，随后往回走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_f4719cb5:

    # v "By the way, your fighting abilities are certainly impressive to say the least. I've not seen many folks who can hit me. You've got me good there."
    v "对了，至少可以说，你的战斗能力确实令人印象深刻。我没见过多少能打中我的人。刚才那一下你可真够狠的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_4d1ca626:

    # v "By the way, your fighting abilities are certainly impressive to say the least. If not for my... feral strength, you might as well beat me up there."
    v "对了，至少可以说，你的战斗能力确实令人印象深刻。要不是我那……野性的力量，你刚才大概就能把我揍趴下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_8fd3de33:

    # e "Thank you, Vurro."
    e "谢谢你，伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_557001cb:

    # v "I'm confident we'll take him down, that I have no doubt."
    v "我确信我们能把他拿下，这点我毫不怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_a0bae689:

    # "You anticipate the next sentence from Vurro, but he seems to have stuck in his thought once more."
    "你等着伏罗说出下一句话，但他似乎又一次陷入了思绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_da11e703:

    # "Towards the path back, it's almost all silence, Vurro does not utter a word, and you don't even dare to speak."
    "走上回去的路后，四周几乎一片寂静；伏罗一言不发，你甚至不敢开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_93500769:

    # "But soon, you two cross the well. Wuldon waves at you from afar, unknowing that his friend almost died in a fight ten minutes ago."
    "但没过多久，你们俩经过水井。伍尔顿在远处向你挥手，却不知道他的朋友十分钟前差点死在一场战斗中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_bbc12a5a:

    # "Vurro waves back, and you follow suit, passing the blue werewolf a wobbly smile."
    "伏罗也挥手回应，你也跟着照做，朝那只蓝色狼人勉强露出一个不太自然的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_06cb388f:

    # v "So, this is the bath. Very primitive I know. But just enough to cleanse the scents on you for a while."
    v "所以，这就是浴池。我知道它简陋得很，不过暂时也足够洗掉你们身上的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_7dd4ed3a:

    # "He points at the wooden tub situated just near the well. The water is steaming with white mist, seemingly just carried out by Wuldon."
    "他指向井边的木桶。水面升腾着白雾，看来是伍尔顿刚打来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_64115b5e:

    # "You notice a few strips of herbs scattered on the surface of the water. With a piece of towel that Vurro picks up lazily."
    "你注意到水面上散落着几缕草药。伏罗懒洋洋地拿起一条毛巾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c3cff024:

    # e "Am I supposed to be sitting in there?"
    e "我该坐进去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_a6c188d9:

    # v "Yeah, and you need to take off your clothes too. Do that separately if you want to keep your clothes dry."
    v "对，而且你也得把衣服脱了。要是不想把衣服弄湿，就在外面单独脱好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c18ca12c:

    # "You nod, though how many times you've been through this, it's still embarrassing to strip naked in front of Vurro, despite how many times you've been that way."
    "你点点头。虽说这事已经做过很多次了，可每次在伏罗面前脱光，还是让你觉得难为情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_8653c8f4:

    # e "O-okay."
    e "哦——好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_528c6e53:

    # "His gaze is still onto you and your clothes, which makes it much more difficult."
    "他的目光依旧落在你和你的衣服上，这让你更难脱下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_78653ea8:

    # v "Relax, I swear I won't tell Wuldon I saw your private part earlier than he does."
    v "放松，我发誓不会告诉伍尔顿我比他更早看到了你的私处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_731bf2ab:

    # "The brown werewolf jokes, and it doesn't ease you anyhow. So you stand staring at him."
    "棕色狼人开着玩笑，却丝毫没让你放松下来。于是你站在那里，瞪着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_aa0759b8:

    # v "I'm gonna see that when you're done stripping anyway."
    v "反正等你脱完，我还是会看到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_797b2501:

    # "Vurro sighs as the pair of eyes gazing in your direction quickly tilts away as he turn on his back."
    "伏罗叹了口气，那双望向你的眼睛很快移开；他翻过身，仰面躺下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_95a0c4e7:

    # "You continue taking off your clothes, one by one until you're bare naked."
    "你继续一件件脱下衣服，直到赤身裸体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_2982540c:

    # e "Done."
    e "好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_5e474a28:

    # v "Alright then, now get in there."
    v "那好，现在进去吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_4977ff11:

    # "You lift your leg up, just enough to step onto the ledge of the wooden tub. Then you leap through with the other leg, dropping leg first into the water."
    "你抬起一条腿，刚好跨上木桶边沿。接着另一条腿也跨进去，先让腿落入水中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_afd7a57d:

    # "Submerged inside the heating water, you take a few seconds to get used to the heat."
    "浸在热水里，你花了几秒钟才适应温度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_ffb1df39:

    # v "How's the bath? Feeling the scent leaving you yet?"
    v "洗得怎么样？感觉身上的气味已经消退了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c78dec6b:

    # e "I think it's my fur that's leaving my skin right now."
    e "我觉得现在离开我皮肤的，是我的毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_3b810813:

    # "Vurro pinches your shoulders, brushing his claws against the wet fur."
    "伏罗捏了捏你的肩膀，爪子擦过湿漉漉的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_b2eda857:

    # v "Huh, you will get used to the heat, don't worry."
    v "嗯，你会适应这温度的，别担心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_6bdda18b:

    # v "Scream if it's really hot though."
    v "不过，要是真的很烫，就叫出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c751618f:

    # "He lifts a wooden ladle from the side, then scoop up some water before pouring onto the back of your neck."
    "他从旁边拿起木勺，舀起一些水，浇在你的后颈上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_0a1c0a92:

    # e "Thanks, Vurro, for preparing the bath."
    e "谢谢你，伏罗，帮我准备了洗澡水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_3c81fdd9:

    # v "Look, I'm not gonna die soon so you can save these gratitude for when we actually fight my brother."
    v "听着，我暂时还不会死，所以等我们真的和我哥哥交手时，你再谢我也不迟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_e9377419:

    # "He places his elbow onto the edge of the wooden tub, before leaning forwards, stiring the water lazily."
    "他把手肘搭在木桶边沿，然后向前俯身，懒洋洋地搅动着水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_63d3e9da:

    # v "The way I see how it'll end for me, is when we're fighting Uffe. The perfect moment for me to leave this world would be right after knowing he's dead."
    v "照我看来，我会在和乌菲交战时走到生命尽头。得知他死去之后，我便离开这个世界——那将是最完美的时刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_6b70138a:

    # "The brown werewolf takes out a bath towel to scratch your back, scrubbing off all scents that you can or cannot smell from your fur."
    "棕色狼人拿出浴巾替你擦背，把你毛发上那些你能闻到或闻不到的气味全都擦掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_4a78eefa:

    # v "I'll likely transform then, the panic and exertion will speed the process up, like what we just had, but ten times more painful."
    v "我可能会在那时变身，恐慌和剧烈运动会加快这个过程，就像刚才那次一样，只不过痛苦程度会高出十倍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_e4f95fbf:

    # "He stands idly, staring blankly onto the forests ahead."
    "他漫不经心地站着，茫然地凝视着前方的森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_8aba69df:

    # v "I will turn into what Uffe wanted me to be, that disgusting form of existence without a thought of humanity."
    v "我会变成乌菲想让我变成的样子，变成那种没有一丝人性意识的、令人作呕的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_5b00b867:

    # "Even if your back is against Vurro, you can feel that sense of dread and sorrow from Vurro."
    "即使你背对着伏罗，也能感受到伏罗身上那股恐惧与悲伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_77c8e9d4:

    # v "[e], when I'm gone, and Uffe is dead, please end that other monster."
    v "[e]，等我不在了，乌菲也死了之后，请杀掉另一个怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_6330931d:

    # "What is Vurro talking about, to... kill him? That came as a pure shock to you that your body instantly froze, even in hot water."
    "伏罗到底在说什么，要……杀了他？这番话着实让你震惊不已，即使泡在热水里，身体也瞬间僵住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_cff2f5b3:

    # e "T-that... I don't know if I can."
    e "这……我不知道自己能不能做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_5e1f8589:

    # v "You're doing that for the safety of other people."
    v "你这么做是为了其他人的安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_20cb9102:

    # "His speech quickens, looking for a response from you, and you only slide deeper into the water."
    "他说话越来越快，急切地想从你这里得到回应，而你只是更加往水里滑去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_678c6fd5:

    # v "The werewolf you saw in the cave, and the same werewolf that you will see fighting against Uffe, they are not me. You know that, right?"
    v "你在洞穴里见到的狼人，还有那个你将会看到与乌菲战斗的狼人，都不是我。你明白，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_e8713aa5:

    # e "But the passionate and loving werewolf is still there, deep inside. Just like when we woke you up."
    e "但那个热情而深情的狼人依然存在，就在内心深处。就像我们唤醒你时一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_6ceaef51:

    # v "Even so, you can't cure a werewolf twice."
    v "即便如此，你也不可能两次治愈狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_34cc3bf6:

    # "Vurro replies as he pour a bucket of bathwater onto your head, a few leaves left hanging on your head."
    "伏罗一边回应，一边将一桶洗澡水浇到你头上，几片叶子还挂在你的头发上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_b23f2ce8:

    # e "I... I can't, you're my friend."
    e "我……我不能，你是我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_1782c2ca:

    # "Vurro looks down, his palm scrubbing against your fur as it keeps soaking in the bathwater."
    "伏罗低头看着你，手掌一边揉搓着你的毛发，你的毛发也不断浸在洗澡水里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_0b6eb35e:

    # v "I remembered telling myself that I didn't mind dying, if it's for the good of our pack."
    v "我记得自己曾告诉过自己，只要是为了我们族群的利益，我不介意死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_f093bbb6:

    # v "Maybe I am not as noble as I thought I am, but this dreading thought of losing myself has been plaguing my mind every second since I woke up. It's a nightmare that never stops ceasing."
    v "也许我没有自己以为的那么高尚，但自从醒来后，害怕失去自我的念头每一秒都在折磨着我。这是一场永无止境的噩梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_3191799a:

    # "He says it with a deeper voice, as if he knew the doom is impending, it's worrying, honestly."
    "他说这话时声音更加低沉，仿佛知道厄运即将降临，说实话，这让人很不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_6cf62877:

    # v "I know I am being selfish, but a part of me hoped I was never cured. I could have died not knowing that the monster I've became killed everyone in the cave."
    v "我知道自己很自私，但我心里有一部分希望自己从未被治愈。那样我就能在不知情的情况下死去，不必知道变成怪物的自己杀死了洞穴里的所有人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_eebdb14c:

    # e "That werewolf is not you. You told me that."
    e "那个狼人不是你。你自己告诉过我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_2f4194e6:

    # "He doesn't respond, instead he wraps his arm around your shoulder, rubbing every inches on your chest."
    "他没有回应，只是伸手搂住你的肩膀，抚摸着你胸口的每一寸肌肤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_bc71ac7d:

    # v "I could have died without seeing Wuldon and you reminding me how much I've had, just to lose them all again."
    v "如果没能见到伍尔顿，也没有你提醒我曾经拥有过多少，我或许已经死去，却又再次失去这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_95d77f69:

    # "The brown werewolf reaches lower, hands tracing around"
    "那头棕色的狼人把手伸向更低处，双手沿着周围摸索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_90524f76:

    # v "But, I'm glad I did. I'm glad to share some more memories with you, finishing my business before I leave, that's not a luxury everyone can afford."
    v "不过，我很庆幸自己这么做了。我很高兴能和你分享更多回忆，在离开前了结自己的事情——这可不是每个人都能享有的奢侈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_b2c81280:

    # "You enjoy the time in the bath with Vurro sniffing and brushing, but at the same time you're just extremely distressed by the unfateful reality."
    "你享受着和伏罗一起泡澡的时光，任由他嗅闻并轻抚着你，但与此同时，这残酷的现实也让你痛苦不堪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_367b985e:

    # v "So, thank you for saving me back in the cave."
    v "那么，谢谢你之前在洞穴里救了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_efefb8dd:

    # "His voice rises, feinting a wide smile to you."
    "他的声音扬了起来，仿佛对你装出灿烂的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_f5af9160:

    # v "[e], take care of Wuldon for me, would you?"
    v "[e]，替我照顾好伍尔顿，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_027182b2:

    # "You nod, you understand the severity of the situation, but it's still surreal to see your own friend telling you his death wishes."
    "你点了点头，明白事态有多严重，可看到自己的朋友亲口告诉你他的临终心愿，仍然觉得不真实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_9fd136a0:

    # e "I- I will."
    e "我——我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_73605a62:

    # v "No, that's not right... I can't tell you what to do on my behalf. Both in whether to kill me, or to take care of Wuldon."
    v "不，不对……我不能替自己要求你该怎么做。无论是杀了我，还是照顾伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_32032484:

    # v "That is a huge cross to bear, and I don't wish it upon you."
    v "那是你必须背负的沉重十字架，我不愿让你承受这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_060d4282:

    # v "I won't be here by the time you two had killed Uffe, it's pointless for you to promise me anything."
    v "等到你们两个杀掉乌菲的时候，我已经不会在这里了，所以你没必要向我承诺什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_4cf67800:

    # "His breathing begins to slow down to a normal pace."
    "他的呼吸开始恢复正常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_a8fe1174:

    # v "But, on a brighter side, you and Wuldon will survive."
    v "不过往好处想，你和伍尔顿都会活下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_14bad1aa:

    # v "You know, however that blue dork might look gruff on the outside, he's still that sweet little werewolf with no friend deep down."
    v "你知道，那个蓝色的笨蛋虽然外表看起来很粗鲁，内心深处仍是那个可爱的小狼人，只是没有朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_abfa8f3a:

    # "Vurro smiles faintly."
    "伏罗淡淡一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_0f23d550:

    # v "Not to talk him down, but it's pretty clear that he likes you a lot, [e]."
    v "我不是要替他说好话，但很明显，他非常喜欢你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_651db163:

    # v "He sucks at letting people know his feelings, but I saw his face blushing like a tomato everytime we talked about you."
    v "他不擅长让别人知道自己的感受，但每次我们谈到你，我都看见他的脸红得像个番茄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_e99423a6:

    # v "I guess what often happens is, you don't resonate that feeling, or that things don't end up working out between you two."
    v "我想，很多时候你并没有同样的感觉，或者你们两人最终没能走到一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_11e71b41:

    # v "Even so, please be gentle with him, he won't have anybody left when I'm gone."
    v "即便如此，请对他温柔一点。我离开后，他就再也没有别人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_2d4e72ff:

    # "You turn to stare at Vurro, who's tapping on the side of the bathtub."
    "你转过身，注视着正在敲浴缸边缘的伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c1ad3e57:

    # e "No, Vurro, I don't think I will ever leave Wuldon after everything we've been through."
    e "不，伏罗，经历了这一切之后，我想我永远都不会离开伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_2f2425e0:

    # v "Hah, good to know. I won't interfere with whatever's going on with you two further."
    v "哈，知道了就好。我不会再干涉你们两个之间的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_c3a98107:

    # v "Well, at least now he has you on his side. That makes me feel a lot better."
    v "至少现在他有你站在他这边了。这让我好受多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_153af1a8:

    # "Before you have even processed what he said, Vurro extends his scrawny hand in front of you."
    "你还没来得及消化他的话，伏罗就把那只瘦削的手伸到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_56f6a9d0:

    # v "Time to get out of the water, little one."
    v "小家伙，该出水了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_2a3e93f3:

    # e "Oh!"
    e "哦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_a97aeff0:

    # "You reach out to grasp onto his hand, but he retreats immediately."
    "你伸手想抓住他的手，可他立刻缩了回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_2ae94726:

    # v "Nuh uh. You don't wanna clean yourself again do you?"
    v "不行。你可不想再自己清洗一遍，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_a5d5529f:

    # "He chides, wiggling his finger in front of you."
    "他一边训斥你，一边在你面前晃着手指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_35ffa886:

    # e "O-okay. You got me there."
    e "好、好吧。被你说中了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Raid_Bath_274ef5b6:

    # msg "Work in Progress! You can save here and continue in the next update, and/or reset the quest and return to the beginning of the quest." nointeract
    msg "开发中！你可以在这里保存，并在下次更新后继续，和/或重置任务并回到任务开头。"
